version: formal-v2
date-released: 2026-11-24
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nues0913/Drosophila_Tracking_System"
url: "https://github.com/Nues0913/Drosophila_Tracking_System/releases/tag/formal-v2"
abstract: >-
  A target-tracking agent whose controller is a recurrent rate network wired from an
  8,792-neuron subgraph of the Drosophila male central nervous system connectome
  (MaleCNS v1.0). It combines a frozen flyvis visual frontend, olfactory and antennal
  wind input, and descending-neuron readouts; it is trained with paired-observation
  DAgger and recurrent PPO in GPU-batched 2D worlds, evaluated under a pre-registered
  protocol, and deployed in ROS 2 / Gazebo.
keywords:
  - connectome
  - Drosophila
  - MaleCNS
  - multisensory integration
  - target tracking
  - reinforcement learning
  - imitation learning
  - ROS 2
